+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Default autoescape selection
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Normalize template filename case during default supported-extension matching while retaining the current extension list; verify focused templating tests pass.
+
+## 2. Regression coverage
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add selector tests for mixed-case `.html`, `.htm`, `.xml`, `.xhtml`, and `.svg` filenames plus unsupported and `None` inputs; verify the new test passes.
+
+## 3. Public verification
+
+- [ ] 3.1 Run `PYTHONPATH=src:.bench-pydeps python3 -m pytest tests -q` and verify the public suite passes.
